abstract: >-
  Experimental infrastructure and frozen pilot campaigns for evaluating
  oracle-gated behavioural repair of LLM-generated finite state machines.
  Includes JSON schemas, deterministic scoring and patch application,
  diagnostic projection, analysis scripts, Tier-A table and figure
  regeneration, tests, and three frozen 90-slot pilot arms (default,
  operation-aware, and operation-inferred repair representation) cited by
  the IST repairability protocol manuscript.
keywords:
  - finite state machines
  - behavioural repairability
  - empirical protocol
  - software engineering empiricism
  - large language models
  - reproducibility
  - model-based testing
